${remote_transition_init:u16} 10 32 71 20 ${make_remote_animation:u16} 07 00 0c 00 6e 10 ${activity_options_to_bundle:u16} 00 00
0c 00 1a 01 ${recents_activity_name:u16} 71 30 ${start_home_safely:u16} 08 01 0e 00
"""
