1a 02 ${launcher_package:u16} 6e 20 ${string_equals:u16} 12 00 0a 01 39 01 03 00
0e 00 12 00 1a 01 ${recents_activity_name:u16} 71 30 ${start_home_safely:u16} 08 01 0e 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00
"""
